        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Adi nthuk tu cho kanloumeipu,",
            "Kalvari ching thang tihou loumak nu makge;",
            "Kandih tan rui alung padik ngam lou khou rui.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He lungning than makmei nun,",
            "Akumma tat nicho nang bumang rui hamma;",
            "Rianramei rui thei pui bam khou,",
            "Duang man ngam the.",
            "",
            "2. Guanga tigai lou o jei kei pui bam,",
            "Rianra theipui bam khou rianra bammei nun guai;",
            "Jaipat lou datro tingkau ringpui chang khou 1@:.",
            "",
            "3. Seitan bantan 1@: mun kumma tuai diu,",
            "Nangbang nun lungning khou neilamei padik diu;",
            "Nang kandih gaipui ram khou 1@: guang pu nithe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
